; AdaptiveMultiStrategyEA - index mean-reversion sleeve for the OANDA index CFD DEMO account (chapters 100 and 103).
; Same rules as AMS_Sleeves_Index.set. The whole balance is used (InpIxEquityOffset=0) with a smaller size: InpIxRevUnitVol=5.
; Why this size: on the broker's own minute data, February 2020 - November 2026 (includes the 2020 crash and the 2022 decline),
;   3,000,000 JPY at 5 earned about +15% to +16% per year with a maximum drawdown of 29% (worst month -18%, worst 12 months -19%;
;   2020 +3%, 2021 +33%, 2022 -12%, 2023 +14%, 2024 +25%, 2025 +16%, 2026 +41%).
;   The reference size 8.75 had a 48% drawdown in the same test. Using the whole balance with a smaller size was more
;   efficient than imitating a 500,000 JPY account (which cannot hold the small positions because of minimum lot sizes).
; To imitate a 500,000 JPY account instead: InpIxEquityOffset = balance - 500000 (see chapter 100).
; Larger sizes: 6.5 -> +21% per year / 36% drawdown, 8.75 -> +26% / 48%, 12.5 (AMS_Sleeves_Index_Growth.set) -> +30% / 56%.
InpEntryMode=8
InpIxRevSymbols=US500,US100,US30
InpIxTrendSymbols=none
InpIxRuleR2=true
InpIxRuleD7=true
InpIxRuleIBS=true
InpIxRevUnitVol=5.0
InpIxTrendUnitVol=0.0
InpIxTrendCheckDays=7
InpIxMaxLev=10.0
InpIxBand=0.25
InpIxSLVolMul=4.0
InpIxVolModel=1
InpIxVixFile=AMS_vix.csv
InpIxVixLowMult=0.5
InpIxVixHighMult=1.5
InpIxRuleWeights=1,2,4
InpIxSoGuard=0.9
InpIxFlatMinutes=0
InpIxFlatEdgeBp=0.0
InpIxDelayMin=5
InpIxMaxSpreadPct=0.05
InpMaxMarginUsePct=90.0
InpIxJointRound=false
InpIxJointEps=0.25
InpIxWarmStart=true
InpIxRegimeDays=1500
InpIxRegimeThr=1.0
InpIxRegimeRef=US500
InpIxDryRun=false
InpIxEquityOffset=0
